{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"MO"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“MO”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$MO$ 是万有 "},{"Local":{"url":"Thom谱","text":"Thom 谱"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$\\pi_n MO$ 可自然等同于闭 $n$ 维流形的配边类的集合.</p>\n<p>$MO$ 是如下余极限,\n$$\r\nMO\\simeq\\operatorname{colim}\\big(BO \\overset{J}{\\to} BGL_1(\\mathbb S) \\to \\mathsf {Spectra}\\big),\r\n$$\n即是 $BO$ 上万有球丛的全空间.</p>\n"}]}}